  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While Long Hair Ancestor dies still haunted by the failed Space Escape Gu made with Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable, his friend Immortal Yi Yan spends fifty years of lifespan to deduce the future. That deduction becomes the Prophecy of Three Venerables: after three great eras, two men and one woman appear as Spectral Soul Demon Venerable, Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, and Great Dream Immortal Venerable, and Great Dream Immortal Venerable solves the Space Escape Gu problem. The same stretch names him a rank eight wisdom path Gu Immortal who often makes accurate one sentence predictions.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "gu_space_escape_gu",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "sys_prophecy_of_three_venerables",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "char_great_dream_immortal_venerable",
        "path_wisdom",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later recall restates the same prophecy when dream realms rise, and treats Spectral Soul Demon Venerable and Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable as already fulfilled parts that deepen belief in the remaining Great Dream Immortal Venerable line.",
      "chapters": [
        734
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court talk names him Long Hair Ancestor’s wisdom path great grandmaster friend and the creator of the Prophecy of Three Venerables, with predictions treated as very accurate.",
      "chapters": [
        879
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under his inspection, Long Hair Ancestor finds that an incomplete immortal killer move from Old Immortal Kong Jue already has shocking value for relocating dead Gu Immortals’ immortal apertures.",
      "chapters": [
        901
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_immortal_kong_jue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit’s origin as Long Hair Ancestor includes that friendship with the wisdom path Gu Immortal who made the prophecy.",
      "chapters": [
        979
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Northern Plains, Inkman City survives among strong human forces in part because its founder, Immortal Yi Yan, paid a heavy price for an agreement with Giant Sun Immortal Venerable, and because the city later shows only one inkman Gu Immortal publicly.",
      "chapters": [
        1082
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "founding-through-a-costly-pact",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_inkman_city",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "History treats Long Hair Ancestor and Immortal Yi Yan as bosom friends: Long Hair Ancestor leaves Lang Ya blessed land, Immortal Yi Yan founds Inkman City, and inkmen and hairy men from those places keep close relations.",
      "chapters": [
        1146
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "founding-through-a-costly-pact",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo Tan Sang later calls Yi Yan the legendary inkman Gu Immortal who created Inkman City.",
      "chapters": [
        1766
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "founding-through-a-costly-pact",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_tan_sang"
      ]
    }
